political math has become a net deficit for Trump.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:29.160
That's a critical line. Who opened his 2024&nbsp;
presidential. Campaign two weeks ago. In 2020,&nbsp;&nbsp;

